# Trust Tasks — code ownership
#
# Each Trust Task specification lives in specs/<slug>/<version>/.
# CODEOWNERS gives every spec its own reviewer set so editors can
# manage their specifications independently. To add a new spec:
#
#   1. Create the folder specs/<slug>/<version>/ with spec.md +
#      payload.schema.json (see CONTRIBUTING-SPECS.md).
#   2. Append a rule below pointing at the team or individual that
#      owns reviews for that slug.
#
# Until working-group teams exist in GitHub, individual specs default
# to the framework editor. Replace @stormer78 with @org/<team> when
# a team is set up.

# Default — anything not matched below
*                                  @stormer78

# Framework material
/SPEC.md                           @stormer78
/CONTRIBUTING.md                   @stormer78
/CONTRIBUTING-SPECS.md             @stormer78
/LICENSE.md                        @stormer78
/SOURCE_CODE.md                    @stormer78
/README.md                         @stormer78

# Build / deploy / tooling
/scripts/                          @stormer78
/.github/                          @stormer78
/package.json                      @stormer78
/specs/spec.meta.schema.json       @stormer78

# Website chrome (everything except the auto-synced specs/ tree)
/website/                          @stormer78
/website/specs/                    # generated by scripts/build-registry.mjs — no owner override needed

# Individual Trust Task specifications — one rule per slug.
# Replace @stormer78 with the editorial team for that slug once it exists.
/specs/kyc-handoff/                @stormer78
/specs/consent-receipt/            @stormer78
/specs/payment-commitment/         @stormer78
/specs/credential-issuance/        @stormer78
/specs/trust-registry-query/       @stormer78
/specs/agent-authorization/        @stormer78
/specs/acl-grant/                  @stormer78
/specs/acl-revoke/                 @stormer78
/specs/acl-change-role/            @stormer78
/specs/acl-list/                   @stormer78
/specs/acl-show/                   @stormer78
